<hr><h2> Yield and total return changes</h2>

<div id="clickable2" class="clickable">
  <a>
    &#8505
  </a>
</div>

<div id="content2" class="content">
    For reference purposes, 5-day historic yield and total return changes are shown, based on the average bond move by bucket. Naturally, the shape of the top and bottom charts is different, due to increasing duration with maturity for the total return charts. 

</div>

